<strong>rip it off its socket</strong>, and toss it across the room! Nothing says &quot;nerfed&quot; like literal dismemberment. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819140/extras/0b9fc44cb4a0d6fe14d8430d58d7f933.poster.avif?t=1774924559\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819140/extras/0b9fc44cb4a0d6fe14d8430d58d7f933.webm?t=1774924559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819140/extras/0b9fc44cb4a0d6fe14d8430d58d7f933.mp4?t=1774924559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</strong> <br>💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀 <br><strong>---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🥊 Parenting 101: Dad of the Year</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighting alone is depressing. Why not hatch a child right there on the blood-soaked ground? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819140/extras/bb18bd5ccfb2e917f3cd467186450ebd.poster.avif?t=1774924559\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819140/extras/bb18bd5ccfb2e917f3cd467186450ebd.webm?t=1774924559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819140/extras/bb18bd5ccfb2e917f3cd467186450ebd.mp4?t=1774924559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hatch the children: Spawn</strong> skeleton offspring in the heat of battle. Give them your best gear and watch them soak up all the damage while you stay pretty.. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emergency Weaponry: Things</strong> getting out of hand? <strong>Grab your child and swing them like a massive spiked club! </strong> Don't worry, they’re skeletons—they’ll snap back together. (Probably). </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</strong> <br>💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀 <br><strong>---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ Skeleton Style: Dragon Bone Z</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who says you need muscles to use Ki? We’ve added skills that pay deep tribute to the legendary Akira Toriyama: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bony Energy Blasts: Collect</strong> skills to unleash classic &quot;Kamehameha&quot; style beams, and spirit bombs—all performed by your rattling ribcage. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819140/extras/90476bcd23b8d22f4ec0a25fcaf738be.poster.avif?t=1774924559\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819140/extras/90476bcd23b8d22f4ec0a25fcaf738be.webm?t=1774924559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819140/extras/90476bcd23b8d22f4ec0a25fcaf738be.mp4?t=1774924559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</strong> <br>💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀 <br><strong>---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💸 Ascension &amp; Spoils of War</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In reality, you can’t have it all—wealth, power, and fame are never in one pocket. But here you took it all, you magnificent bag of bones! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Road to Riches: Battle</strong> through fixed stages to hoard wealth, power, and fame. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819140/extras/14d348a0e63e2e21af472652e333e82c.poster.avif?t=1774924559\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819140/extras/14d348a0e63e2e21af472652e333e82c.webm?t=1774924559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819140/extras/14d348a0e63e2e21af472652e333e82c.mp4?t=1774924559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skyward Bound: Get Wings</strong>, go vertical. You aren't just cutting grass horizontally anymore; you’re soaring upward, breaking through the clouds to touch the ceiling of ultimate power. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819140/extras/73c65ccb2d8c79c3097fab576eb8abcc.poster.avif?t=1774924559\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819140/extras/73c65ccb2d8c79c3097fab576eb8abcc.webm?t=1774924559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819140/extras/73c65ccb2d8c79c3097fab576eb8abcc.mp4?t=1774924559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</strong> <br>💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀 <br><strong>---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👯 Friendship Ender: Messy vs. C7</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local PvP is officially open. </strong> Call up your best mate (ideally one you don't mind losing). You can cooperate to survive, or you can play as Messy and literally tear the limbs off his C7. In this game, there are no permanent friends—only permanent bones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</strong> <br>💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀💀 🦴 💀 🦴 💀 <br><strong>---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819140/extras/806612f086e12d7488828dfb5d3d4363.poster.avif?t=1774924559\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819140/extras/806612f086e12d7488828dfb5d3d4363.webm?t=1774924559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819140/extras/806612f086e12d7488828dfb5d3d4363.mp4?t=1774924559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "A cursed survivor-style action game with a bony twist! Design dances and share to prove you’re the most stylish reaper alive, rip limbs off bosses, fire Dragon-Ball-inspired energy beams, hatch your children and swing them as clubs. Local PvP included—friends are temporary, but bones are forever!", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819140/7670d6e44e894d4cb2292edfc97f777b1f32759e/header.jpg?t=1774924559", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819140/dccd3d9ec4f57fb2e9862f2acb963c69e8faa022/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774924559", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819140/dccd3d9ec4f57fb2e9862f2acb963c69e8faa022/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774924559", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> nVidia GeForce GTX 280 series or higher<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel core i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> nVidia GeForce GTX 280 series or higher<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><u